   289	// LinkShareToken is the response for the link-share auth endpoint. It embeds the
   290	// authenticated share alongside the issued JWT and re-exposes the project id
   291	// (which LinkSharing hides with json:"-"). The embedded share's write-only
   292	// Password is blanked by AuthenticateLinkShare before this is returned.
